SUMMARY:Next Gen: Round Table
DESCRIPTION:This series is designed to create an interactive\, community-driven learning experience where guests can build relationships & gain insights.\n\nJoin us for the Next Gen Round Table as we partner with Cabalar Meat Co. and bring together four local leaders for an interactive\, small-group learning experience.\n\nSponsored by: A1 Energy\n\nAttendees will rotate between each leader in twenty-minute sessions. Every leader will follow a structured guide\, and guests will receive thoughtful questions to help spark meaningful conversation.\n\nThis event is designed to build relationships\, share insights\, and create an approachable space to learn from leaders in our community.\n\nWe also need your help! We are partnering with Conestoga Valley Christian Community Services to support their Weekend Blessings Program\, which sends food home with children for the weekend.\n\nIf you bring one of the items below to this free event\, you will receive an extra raffle ticket as a thank you for supporting the cause.\n\nMost needed items:\nPop-top cans of soup\nChef Boyardee-type canned pasta\nMac and cheese cups\nRamen or cup noodles\nFruit cups\nApplesauce cups\n\nThank you for helping us make an impact beyond the room! \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Register Now
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/next-gen-round-table-4/
LOCATION:Cabalar Meat Co.\, 501 W Lemon St\, Lancaster\, 17603
CATEGORIES:Community
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/Next-Gen-Round-Table-May-Meet-The-Leaders.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Next Generation of Lancaster%2C PA":MAILTO:ej.pratt522@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
