SUMMARY:Lancaster Fringe Fest
DESCRIPTION:The inaugural Lancaster Fringe Festival takes place from May 21–24\, 2026\, in Lancaster\, PA. Produced in collaboration with Creative Works of Lancaster\, the festival features over 70 acts across 20 venues. \n\n\n\nTicketing: The festival uses a “Pay-What-You-Decide” model. A $10 wristband provides entry to all participating venues. Ticket payments are made directly to the creators. \n\n\n\n\n    tickets
