SUMMARY:Maejean Vintage Sweet 16 Open House
DESCRIPTION:In celebration of Maejean Vintage’s 16th anniversary\, we will be open for walk-ins on May 23rd from 10-3. We will have our full stock of inventory out to shop\, including never before seen pieces available for the first time at this event! Feel free to bring friends and enjoy some spring-themed refreshments. We look forward to seeing you! \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
